{"4028770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OBVERSE", "steam_appid": 4028770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is slowly tearing itself apart after a failed experiment, and no one is left to stop it except a cryogenic test subject awakened years after the incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBVERSE is an immersive first-person sci-fi mystery focused on exploration and problem-solving set in a secret underground research facility. Find creative solutions to every obstacle, outsmart hostile machines, and uncover the truth behind a failed experiment threatening to collapse reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/dfed45bf9d60164ab4899d12cf5e1c84.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace, follow only your curiosity, and find your own solutions to each obstacle you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a highly interactive environment where there is never just one path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/068b039ae3a7d7a05f8aa819e1d4b69e.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the larger mystery while learning the rules and systems governing the world around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use that knowledge to solve problems, discover hidden interactions, and access previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9b69110d747cd1def0e4129b84286732.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9b69110d747cd1def0e4129b84286732.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/9b69110d747cd1def0e4129b84286732.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/489a006a991659313d4bb777dc06d1fe.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security drones, combat robots, and automated defenses stalk the facility. Sneak past, disable, or fight them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is a puzzle where direct combat is only one of the many possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/53616be503ad5bea58769a17258971e9.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/53616be503ad5bea58769a17258971e9.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/53616be503ad5bea58769a17258971e9.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/caa14fb8f96c0fbb09269a14a7c02313.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect power, overload circuits, disable or reprogram robots, commandeer drones, repair devices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find creative ways to exploit and interact with a variety of interconnected systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is slowly tearing itself apart after a failed experiment, and no one is left to stop it except a cryogenic test subject awakened years after the incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OBVERSE is an immersive first-person sci-fi mystery focused on exploration and problem-solving set in a secret underground research facility. Find creative solutions to every obstacle, outsmart hostile machines, and uncover the truth behind a failed experiment threatening to collapse reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/dfed45bf9d60164ab4899d12cf5e1c84.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace, follow only your curiosity, and find your own solutions to each obstacle you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a highly interactive environment where there is never just one path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/744d6e412e4706062db779c46de6310e.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/068b039ae3a7d7a05f8aa819e1d4b69e.webp?t=1780153861\" width=767 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the larger mystery while learning the rules and systems governing the world around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use that knowledge to solve problems, discover hidden interactions, and access previously unreachable areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite