wer, overload circuits, disable or reprogram robots, commandeer drones, repair devices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find creative ways to exploit and interact with a variety of interconnected systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.poster.avif?t=1780153861\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.webm?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/extras/2b122ebd973130c4e2b399179784445b.mp4?t=1780153861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "OBVERSE is an immersive first-person sci-fi mystery focused on exploration and problem-solving set in a secret underground research facility. Find creative solutions to every obstacle, outsmart hostile machines, and uncover the truth behind a failed experiment threatening to collapse reality itself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/7fecd65b42528af8a025a17605144fe50cdd3415/header.jpg?t=1780153861", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/57c6bbb6dd888085955330b258b544db774040a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780153861", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028770/57c6bbb6dd888085955330b258b544db774040a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780153861", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor an